<view class="page"><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}<button bindtap="load">重试</button></view><view wx:if="{{busy && !row}}" class="empty">正在读取档案…</view><block wx:if="{{row}}"><view class="hero"><view class="row"><view class="title">{{row.title}}</view><text class="badge {{row.demo?'demo':''}}">{{row.demo?'演示':'用户录入'}}</text></view><view class="muted">{{row.org}} · {{row.status}}</view></view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">边界与位置</view><map wx:if="{{hasLocation}}" id="land-map" class="map" latitude="{{latitude}}" longitude="{{longitude}}" scale="16" markers="{{markers}}" polygons="{{polygons}}" enable-satellite="{{satellite}}" bindupdated="readyMap" binderror="mapFail"/><view wx:else="" class="empty">尚未登记有效边界或经纬度，请在 PC 端补充。</view><view wx:if="{{mapError}}" class="error">{{mapError}}</view><view wx:if="{{hasLocation}}" class="actions"><button bindtap="openLocation">打开地块位置</button><button bindtap="satellite">{{satellite?'标准地图':'卫星底图'}}</button></view><view class="note">{{polygons.length?'展示已登记的外边界；含孔洞的地块不表示孔洞区域。':'当前仅展示登记位置，不代表已有实测边界。'}}卫星底图不包含自动识别或 NDVI。坐标为近似显示转换，面积以档案记录为准。</view></view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">地块档案</view><view class="kv" wx:for="{{fields}}" wx:key="label"><text class="key">{{item.label}}</text><text class="value">{{item.value}}</text></view><view class="kv"><text class="key">更新时间</text><text class="value">{{row.updated_at}}</text></view></view><view wx:if="{{relatedError}}" class="error">关联记录读取失败：{{relatedError}}</view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">关联生长记录 · {{growth.length}}</view><view wx:if="{{!growth.length}}" class="muted">暂无通过地块编号关联的生长记录。</view><view wx:for="{{growth}}" wx:key="id" class="kv"><text class="key">{{item.title}}</text><text class="value">{{item.data.stage||item.status}} · {{item.demo?'演示':'用户录入'}}</text></view></view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">关联农事任务 · {{tasks.length}}</view><view wx:if="{{!tasks.length}}" class="muted">暂无通过地块编号关联的农事任务。</view><view wx:for="{{tasks}}" wx:key="id" class="kv"><text class="key">{{item.title}}</text><text class="value">{{item.status}} · {{item.demo?'演示':'用户录入'}}</text></view></view></block></view>
